      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Took a second to check this out. On both Live and Beta the IK rates are exactly the same, no matter what speed I move at. From what I've been told, Selfie Expression is meant to have its own IK rate, but I've personally never seen this. In that case it is either a bug, or has yet to actually be implemented in the client.\n\n[Video.](https://www.dropbox.com/scl/fi/1dkduh4knun9v662d01m8/Desktop-IK-Live-VS-Beta-50mb.mp4?rlkey=1tqe24cofqzpbnlg2qidh1eo4&st=q2jcyi6m&dl=0)",
      "viewerReactions": null,
