      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "[Build 1628 - steam-audio-beta]\n\nTesting with the world debug menu 4, I get the following sync intervals:\n\n- VR users at about 0.1 (~10Hz)\n\n- Desktop users at about 0.25 (~4Hz)\n\n- Desktop users with Selfie Expression at about 0.25 (~4Hz)\n\n- A Mobile user with Selfie Expression enabled but not tracking also had an interval of about 0.25 (~4Hz)\n\nSo yes, it seems that something is not working quite right here.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
