      "value": "@{62527baf8c368f529a82aebd|full_name} i wish we could get an explanation for why desktop’s users sync intervals are so low. will they ever tell us why? is this intended? are we left in the dust? will they ever fix it? probably not. it would be cool to see desktop players get actual love but i mean, theyre adding all these dumb group features, drones, stickers, and all this crap, instead of fixing sht like this.",
